;PROGRAM NAME: 1001
;GCODE CREATED ON 2026-11-22 AT 09-26-46

;POST: DUET 2 ETHERNET / RRF 2.05.1 CNC (ULTIMATEREPRAPPOST FORK)
;   TARGET: DUET 2 ETHERNET, REPRAPFIRMWARE 2.05.1, CNC MODE (M453)
;TOOLS IN THIS PROGRAM
;   T2 D=6 CR=0 - ZMIN=-3 - FLAT END MILL

;POST SETTINGS USED
;  RETRACT STRATEGY: FUSION CLEARANCE HEIGHT IN ACTIVE WCS BEFORE XY MOVES
;  SAFE MACHINE Z (G53): 0 (USED)
;  MANUAL TOOL CHANGE: YES, PARK AT G53 X0 Y0
;  TN OUTPUT: NONE, PROBE AFTER TOOL CHANGE: NONE
;  SPINDLE DWELL: PROPORTIONAL, SPINDLE STOP DWELL: 10S
;  HOME ON TOOL CHANGE (G28): NO, END WITH M0: NO
;PREREQUISITES BEFORE PRESSING START
;  1. MACHINE HOMED. 2. FIRMWARE IN CNC MODE (M453). 3. ACTIVE WCS ORIGIN SET FOR THIS SETUP (G10 L20).
;  4. FIRST TOOL MOUNTED AND ITS Z ZERO VALID. 5. SAFE MACHINE Z AND TOOL CHANGE XY CLEAR ALL CLAMPS WITH THE LONGEST TOOL.
;  THE POST DOES NOT KNOW THE MACHINE POSITION AT START. THE FIRST MOTION IS A Z MOVE IN THE CHOSEN RETRACT STRATEGY.

;-+- PROGRAM BEGINS HERE -+-
G90
G21
M300
M291 P"Homed, WCS zeroed, T2 D6 mounted? First move is Z retract. OK starts, Cancel aborts" R"Start job" S3

;TITLE-> OPERATION 2D CONTOUR1
M291 P"Now operating: 2D Contour1" R"Current operation" S1 T5
;LOGGING-> FIRST TOOL T2 MUST ALREADY BE MOUNTED
;TOOL T2 (NO TN OUTPUT, SEE POST PROPERTY TN OUTPUT)
M3 S12000
;DWELL FOR SPINDLE TO REACH SPEED
M291 P"Waiting 30 s for the spindle to reach 12000 RPM" R"Spindle" S1 T20
G4 P30000
G54
G0 Z15
G0 X0 Y-10
G0 Z5
G1 Z-3 F300
G1 Y0 F1000
G1 X50
G3 X60 Y10 R10
G1 Y40
G1 X0
G1 Y0
G0 Z15

;TITLE-> OPERATION FACE G55
M291 P"Now operating: Face G55" R"Current operation" S1 T5
G55
G0 Z12
G0 X0 Y0
G0 Z2
G1 Z0 F300
G1 X80 F2000
G1 Y10
G1 X0
G0 Z12

;-+- PROGRAM END -+-
M5
;WAIT FOR SPINDLE TO STOP
G4 P10000
M400
M291 P"Program finished. Spindle off" R"Program end" S1 T10
;TOOL MOTION BOX (COMMANDED COORDINATES IN THE ACTIVE WCS, AFTER ANY COMPENSATION)
; ON X:  MIN: 0   MAX: 80 
; ON Y:  MIN: -10   MAX: 40 
; ON Z:  MIN: -3   MAX: 15 
